classDiagram
    class Task {
        -String description
        -String time
        -String frequency
        -date dueDate
        -bool completed
        -String priority
        +markComplete() void
    }

    class Pet {
        -String name
        -String breed
        -List~Task~ tasks
        +addTask(task) void
        +removeTask(task) void
    }

    class Owner {
        -String name
        -List~Pet~ pets
        +addPet(pet) void
        +getAllTasks() List~Task~
    }

    class Scheduler {
        -Owner owner
        +getTodaysSchedule() List~Task~
        +sortByTime(tasks) List~Task~
        +filterTasks(petName, completed) List~Task~
        +detectConflicts() List~String~
        +markTaskComplete(pet, task) Task
    }

    Owner "1" --> "0..*" Pet : has
    Pet "1" --> "0..*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : reads tasks from
    Scheduler ..> Task : sorts, filters, schedules
